  "title": [
    "[Elemental Confluence]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "The ever-changing landscape ahead morphs from solid rock into a gushing torrent, the water just as suddenly evaporating into a monstrous spray of dense steam.  Fire bolts relentlessly pummel the surroundings, marring the ground with sunken craters that fling earthen debris into the wind.  Unstable columnar rotations are relentlessly dispatched from a cluster of low-hanging leaden grey clouds overhead."
  ],
